  "description": "One choice of several that can be on together, such as the word categories a room draws from. On shows lime and a tick, as a selected option does; Off shows a plus, so a chip keeps its width when toggled. Hover darkens the border; keyboard focus is the shared 2 px ink ring. Locked is the last chip on where one must stay: it keeps On’s look, a press does nothing, and it points at its field’s helper, which says why. Use Filter chip when exactly one in a row is chosen.",
